    "Offline Mode is on, so cloud Read Aloud voices cannot be used. Pick the on-device macOS voice in Settings → Read Aloud, or turn Offline Mode off in Settings → Privacy & Permissions." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Offline-Modus ist an, deshalb lassen sich die Cloud-Stimmen zum Vorlesen nicht nutzen. Wählen Sie die macOS-Stimme unter Einstellungen → Vorlesen oder schalten Sie den Offline-Modus unter Einstellungen → Datenschutz & Berechtigungen aus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Offline Mode is on, so nothing may leave this Mac — the request to %@ was blocked. Use an on-device model, or turn Offline Mode off in Settings → Privacy & Permissions." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Offline-Modus ist an, deshalb darf nichts diesen Mac verlassen. Die Anfrage an %@ wurde blockiert. Nutzen Sie ein Modell auf dem Gerät oder schalten Sie den Offline-Modus unter Einstellungen → Datenschutz & Berechtigungen aus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Offline dictation: Parakeet Ultra by Moondream, a retraining of NVIDIA Parakeet TDT 0.6B v3, and NVIDIA Parakeet CTC 110M for Glossary terms — all licensed CC BY 4.0 — downloaded as FluidInference's Core ML conversions and run through FluidAudio (Apache 2.0). Whisper models by OpenAI (MIT), run through WhisperKit (MIT) by Argmax." : {},
    "Offline models allow you to transcribe audio without an internet connection. Models are automatically downloaded from HuggingFace and cached locally." : {},
    "One-time download, %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Einmaliger Download, %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One-time download, then it runs offline. Your message is sent as soon as it's ready." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Einmaliger Download, danach läuft es offline. Ihre Nachricht wird gesendet, sobald alles bereit ist."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only delete interaction history and context; settings are preserved" : {},
    "Only for Gemini models, and only for what you have connected in Settings → Accounts. Nothing is changed, created or sent. A lookup adds a few seconds to that one request." : {},
    "Only models with audio input are listed — anything else fails at request time. Full catalogue:" : {},
    "Only read" : {},
    "Only the microphone is required. The rest is optional and can wait — change any of it later in Settings → Privacy & Permissions." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nur das Mikrofon ist nötig. Der Rest ist optional und kann warten. Alles lässt sich später unter Einstellungen → Datenschutz & Berechtigungen ändern."
          }
        }
      }
    },
